  117 : // (The non-B-aware ItotFull/solveEFull/ItotHalf/solveEHalf that used to
  118 : // live here were dead code -- never called; the actual solve uses only
  119 : // the B-aware solveEFullB/solveEHalfB from bfield_3d_slit.idp. Removed
  120 : // rather than left stale, since leaving them would mean an un-fixed
  121 : // duplicate missing the Hastelloy branch below sitting right next to
